  "label": "Social Rejection and Disengagement Meme Tropes",
  "description": "The meme format of declaring a permanent disengagement from a group ('never drinking with you fuckers ever again') is a common trope in internet culture. It often serves as a humorous or aggressive way to express social distancing or anger. Understanding this trope requires knowledge of online communication patterns and meme conventions.",
